CORE
main.c

^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] .* zero\-initialised: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] .* the written element: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] .* the written element is not 0: FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
A zero-initialised global is array_of(0): every element is 0 until written.
